# Optional SHA-256 denylist of high-entropy secrets that must NEVER appear in this repo.
# IMPORTANT OPSEC NOTE: Only add SHA-256 hashes of high-entropy secrets (>=128 bits,
# such as UUIDs or 256-bit keys). NEVER store unsalted SHA-256 hashes of IPv4
# addresses here, as the entire 32-bit IPv4 space is trivially brute-forceable.
#
# Format: one lowercase hex SHA-256 digest per line (`printf '%s' "<secret>" | shasum -a 256`).
